// Hand-curated catalog of TB2 invocations. The page reference is the
// source of truth for ritual prose and factor tables; "data needed to
// play" (name, circle, traditions, ritual kind/Ob, time/burden tuple,
// relic + slot, sacramental) lives inline.
//
// Theurge invocations are sourced from the Dungeoneer's Handbook
// (DH p.209-231); shaman invocations from the Lore Master's Manual
// (LMM p.41-58). Per RAW (LMM p.41 "Do not merge this list with the
// theurge's list in the Dungeoneer's Handbook"), invocations that
// appear under both names are recorded as separate entries with
// distinct ids — their effect text and burden costs differ subtly.

